inductive PrecompileMethodFunction where
  | typeintersectEnv
  | indexedIterate
  | compilerSpecializeMethod
  | precompile

/-- Runtime values preserve the original Type and Method objects and
all unrestricted intermediate values. Type does not fix the concrete type
object used for dispatch. Every later generic call likewise has an unfixed
operand type. call denotes the selected method of the exact tagged function,
with the complete positional argument list; no output law is assumed.
The installed Core interface supplies actual getfield and native Int values.
It handles malformed indexed_iterate results at their real projection points.
